WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
How to make the proja not dry,

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.520
but perfectly soft, juicy and airy?

3
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.940
The secret is in the exact proportions.

4
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.500
Mix 12 spoons of cornmeal,

5
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
4 spoons of white flour,

6
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.300
add baking powder, 3 eggs,

7
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.980
200 ml of yogurt, 200 ml of sparkling water,

8
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.960
100 ml of oil and 250 g of feta cheese.

9
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.040
Mix well,

10
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.060
but boldly leave pieces of cheese like this.

11
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.580
For the first 10 minutes bake at 200 degrees,

12
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.660
and then reduce to 180 and bake for another 20 minutes.

13
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.400
Enjoy the softest and juiciest proja.